(function(){var r=window.matchMedia("(prefers-color-scheme: light)").matches?"light":"dark",h=localStorage.getItem("theme")??r;document.documentElement.setAttribute("saved-theme",h);var o=a=>{document.body?.classList.remove("theme-dark","theme-light"),document.body?.classList.add(`theme-${a}`)},n=a=>{let s=new CustomEvent("themechange",{detail:{theme:a}});document.dispatchEvent(s)},e=()=>{let a=document.documentElement.getAttribute("saved-theme")??"light";o(a);let s=()=>{let t=document.documentElement.getAttribute("saved-theme")==="dark"?"light":"dark";document.documentElement.setAttribute("saved-theme",t),localStorage.setItem("theme",t),o(t),n(t)},d=t=>{let i=t.matches?"dark":"light";document.documentElement.setAttribute("saved-theme",i),localStorage.setItem("theme",i),o(i),n(i)};for(let t of document.getElementsByClassName("darkmode"))t.addEventListener("click",s),window.addCleanup(()=>t.removeEventListener("click",s));let l=window.matchMedia("(prefers-color-scheme: dark)");l.addEventListener("change",d),window.addCleanup(()=>l.removeEventListener("change",d))};document.addEventListener("nav",e),document.addEventListener("render",e)})(),(function(){var r=!1,h=n=>{let e=new CustomEvent("readermodechange",{detail:{mode:n}});document.dispatchEvent(e)},o=()=>{let n=()=>{r=!r;let e=r?"on":"off";document.documentElement.setAttribute("reader-mode",e),h(e)};for(let e of document.getElementsByClassName("readermode"))e.addEventListener("click",n),window.addCleanup(()=>e.removeEventListener("click",n));document.documentElement.setAttribute("reader-mode",r?"on":"off")};document.addEventListener("nav",o),document.addEventListener("render",o)})(),(function(){window.__SF_DEV=!1,window.__SF_CFG={eggs:["Every record agrees on one thing: it was bright.","The sky did not fall. It was taken down.","If you can name every star, you were not there.","We counted the survivors twice. The second count was shorter.","Do not trust a map drawn after the Starfall. Trust the mapmaker who admits to being lost.","Three witnesses, three skies.","Wherever it is quiet, it is listening.","A crater is only a door that remembers being opened.","Burn the first draft of the sky.","The ledger says forty. The ledger was written by the forty-first.","What the sky remembers, the ground forgets.","Some stars you may name. Others name you.","Light takes a long time to arrive. Guilt takes longer.","If you hear your own voice in the Crater, do not answer.","There were eleven years we do not speak of.","Careful with the thin places. They are thin on both sides.","The old constellations are still there. We simply stopped being able to see them from here.","Count the stars twice. If the numbers differ, trust neither.","A promise made under a falling sky binds whoever catches it.","You caught a falling star. Most people only watch.","Not every light in the sky is looking down.","Wish carefully. The last one who did is still paying for it.","Someone has to draw where the world is thin. Someone has to be thin enough to draw it.","The Archivist keeps what the Vigil would rather you forgot.","The collection is incomplete. This is not an editorial choice. \u2014 a note in the Vigil records","Three members before. Four members after. Total membership unchanged. The arithmetic is precise. The identities are not. \u2014 a Vigil record","We know that something moved in the southern survey zone that none of our constructs produced. \u2014 a recovered transmission","The vaults will seal when the network fails. This is designed. Whatever comes after will have to find their own way in, and we have made that \u2014 \u2014 a fragment from the Deep Vault, the rest lost","The constructs are in position. This is the one thing that went as planned and it may not be enough. \u2014 a fragment of unknown origin","It is included because the record should be complete even when the record is incomplete. \u2014 a note in the Vigil records","No further explanation is required or will be provided. \u2014 a notice of the Permanent Witness Body","No further orders regarding this reallocation will be issued through standard channels. \u2014 a Strategic Administration order","Whether it is also what the Warden asked is a question I have decided not to ask. \u2014 V. Sorath, Third Forge District","In the beginning there was only the ground, and the ground was hot, and the heat was not suffering but instruction. \u2014 an oral history, third-hand","They followed because something in the way he moved suggested they should. \u2014 an oral history","I have written what I was given. I have not written what I believe. These are not always the same document. \u2014 an archivist, ~4,500 BCE","Gravity has lost its resolve. \u2014 Asterion, on the day of the Starfall","No, boy. The earth is falling. We are merely being left behind. \u2014 Asterion","The Master is a painting that refuses to dry. \u2014 a deacon, of Asterion","If the darkness moves, it is a confession. \u2014 a witness at the Meridian","Asterion's ledger from this period has never been recovered. \u2014 the Archivist","Asterion's field notes from this period were later revised. The original reads differently. \u2014 the Archivist","I did not take it from his notes. I do not know why we used the same words. \u2014 the Archivist","This account supersedes the version dated ~45 AD. Differences between editions have not been disclosed. \u2014 the Long Record","If the Cosmic Devourer exists, no one currently knows where it is, what it wants, or whether the Starfall was its arrival, its escape, or merely its first breath. \u2014 the Archivist","And if you're reading this \u2014 it already knows. \u2014 from the pages on the Cosmic Devourer","She told them the truth, because she hadn't yet learned that the truth wasn't what the room wanted. \u2014 an account from the Capital","He felt a door close somewhere in the lower city, the way one feels a held breath finally let go three rooms away. \u2014 an account from the Capital","She kept the journal under a false bottom in her desk drawer. It had seemed prudent. \u2014 a recovered journal","The false panel is of note. It predates the clearance by at least eighteen months. \u2014 a Witness Body deliberation record","Neither source uses a name. \u2014 the Archivist, on a recovered journal","The glaciers are bleeding. The paths are turning to rivers. \u2014 Thorall","The water is losing its breath. \u2014 Aaron","He is testing your obedience, Krysta, not your strength. \u2014 a voice in the sulfur","The world is finally in its proper place. No chaos. We have perfected the Reflection. \u2014 the High Prelate","No further record of this encounter exists. The fin in question is unaccounted for. \u2014 a filed account","Asterion survives \u2014 not because he planned it, but because he was no longer centralized. \u2014 the Long Record","Complete document. Filed under routine maintenance, which is the category it was submitted under. \u2014 a note in the Vigil records","Three of the eleven signatories do not appear in any other document before or after this date. \u2014 a note in the Vigil records","The page ends here. Whether the document continues beyond this page is not known. The sentence does not. \u2014 the Archivist"],entries:[{slug:"the-starfall-universe",hint:"A map, mostly accurate"},{slug:"lore-and-stories/documents/the-molten-vigil-\u2014-recovered-transmissions-and-records",hint:"Transmissions no one was meant to read"},{slug:"lore-and-stories/stories/the-aftermath/what-the-sky-remembers",hint:"What the sky remembers"}],landingSlug:"index",journalSlug:"journal",landing:{kicker:"",title:"The Starfall Universe",lines:["Something fell, and no one agrees on what.","A few records survived. The marked stars are ways in.","Look closely at any star and it will tell you what it is."]}}})();
